  <name>Airplane Combat Simulator</name>
  <summary>High-performance tactical 3D flight simulator and dogfighting engine</summary>

  <developer id="io.github._0x07dc">
    <name>0x07dc</name>
  </developer>

  <description>
    <p>
      Airplane Combat Simulator is a military-grade, high-performance 3D tactical flight simulator
      and aerial dogfighting engine engineered in pure Zig with Vulkan 1.3 hardware acceleration
      and native Wayland client windowing.
    </p>
    <p>Features include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>High-fidelity flight aerodynamics with mild G-Force Fly-By-Wire (FBW) assistance.</li>
      <li>Spherical planetary combat theater with 22 procedural cities, skyscrapers, and moving surface traffic.</li>
      <li>Naval aircraft carrier operations featuring stern glide-slope approaches and arrestor wire trapping.</li>
      <li>Tactical 3D cyber-avionics HUD with pitch ladder, velocity vector, CCIP bomb reticle, and horizon detection.</li>
      <li>Basic Fighter Maneuvers (BFM) tactical doctrine with High/Low Yo-Yos and lead pursuit calculations.</li>
      <li>Non-blocking UDP multiplayer network architecture with Hermite client interpolation and LAN Party Direct Connect.</li>
      <li>Fleet-scaled match point win limits (50, 100, 200 points) and a 15-minute regulation combat timer with holographic post-mission debriefing.</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

